      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Figure 4.X (Revised) \u2014 CrypTransfer Class Diagram",
      "fontSize": 22,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 22,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Figure 4.X (Revised) \u2014 CrypTransfer Class Diagram",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "cd0000136",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -158,
      "width": 1183.8400000000001,
      "height": 17.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 197981077,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 777700808,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1782145952822,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Updated from the original thesis class diagram to match the live Flutter + Firebase implementation (Repository pattern over Cloud Firestore / Storage).",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 14,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Updated from the original thesis class diagram to match the live Flutter + Firebase implementation (Repository pattern over Cloud Firestore / Storage).",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "cd0000137",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -130,
      "width": 1008.0000000000001,
      "height": 90.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 297229584,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1913279574,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1782145952822,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Note: No central SystemController \u2014 UI screens/controllers (LoginScreen, SenderScreen, ReceiverScreen, AdminDashboard, ...) call repositories and\nservices directly. No TLSChannel class \u2014 TLS is handled transparently by the Firebase SDKs over HTTPS. No persistent RSAKeys/AESKey/File entities \u2014\nthe RSA public key lives inline on UserModel.publicKey, the AES key+IV are ephemeral (never persisted in plaintext, only RSA-wrapped inside\nTransferModel.encryptedAESKey), and chunked file I/O is handled by static TransferService helpers rather than a File model. No generic Database facade\n\u2014 7 specialized repositories wrap Cloud Firestore/Storage instead of one God class. The thesis CleanupManager became two collaborating classes:\nCleanupRepository (Firestore writes) + SecurityLifecycleMixin (in-memory zero-remanence buffer wipe).",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 12,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Note: No central SystemController \u2014 UI screens/controllers (LoginScreen, SenderScreen, ReceiverScreen, AdminDashboard, ...) call repositories and\nservices directly. No TLSChannel class \u2014 TLS is handled transparently by the Firebase SDKs over HTTPS. No persistent RSAKeys/AESKey/File entities \u2014\nthe RSA public key lives inline on UserModel.publicKey, the AES key+IV are ephemeral (never persisted in plaintext, only RSA-wrapped inside\nTransferModel.encryptedAESKey), and chunked file I/O is handled by static TransferService helpers rather than a File model. No generic Database facade\n\u2014 7 specialized repositories wrap Cloud Firestore/Storage instead of one God class. The thesis CleanupManager became two collaborating classes:\nCleanupRepository (Firestore writes) + SecurityLifecycleMixin (in-memory zero-remanence buffer wipe).",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "cd0000138",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -10,
      "width": 1014.7200000000001,
